{
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "voice": "voice-00",
  "generation": "Arena TTS selected voice; incomplete",
  "alignment": "one-clip-one-shot-one-caption",
  "slowdown_allowed": false,
  "max_speedup_factor": 1.55,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "这场逃亡跨越七十八天，五条生命在途中消逝。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "339c8393e629494537d79622b09e5b365f5cd54179c16784c306183dd45508f8",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.41
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "最终识破他的，竟是一名小学五年级的女孩。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "f27ebacb33acde56116835c338ed0e755d09218addf8d65bafff0d0de3b469ea",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.435
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "一九六三年十月十八日，福冈县两名男子遇害。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "d20015e2372e0771271334589596fc7ed9a9511fce1f8cfe749f7dd2c4f2bf10",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.516
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "警方根据目击证言等线索，很快锁定一名嫌疑人。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "78468226e3e0054b1e26d0d591a6f16ea6f6b9a837495f648f7b2e5573138d48",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.307
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "他叫西口彰，当时三十七岁，曾因诈骗和盗窃获罪。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "3900803f58bf857e2ddbd027261affa8d0d019cb8657534e7e58680d8ad84a17",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.921
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "福冈警方随即发出全国通缉，寻找他的踪迹。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "1cf23704dae196468a955d28adc56b7c93b0aeeb5407fbda7ba2ebe6c6cbeb72",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.725
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "逃亡途中，西口从报纸上得知，自己已被通缉。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "82fcb8376473a00da3773fd0b214b1d0fa1dea6da180be140c3d1f0030fdcd35",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.516
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "濑户内海的渡轮上，他留下一双鞋和一封信。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "53eae80ba0cc6c0d8346449cc57e46e5063b3489c5354405f8e0641156b91971",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.9
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "这场假死只是障眼法，他已经换了身份继续逃亡。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "610ab09210daad94c82d223f36eb9d64e2241d82f0a402cb42a53ac6643e668a",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.027
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "搜寻没有结果，警方判断，所谓自杀只是伪装。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "847ddc3ab4f79352ef6548e767229b655abd894947c7bea5ac61f13b2ac27969",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.329
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "他辗转各地，时而自称教授，用体面外表赢得信任。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "20d525e164bb959ec6690f8a4673402668dfb9b08c82ff6a18a334c0974b4c43",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.712
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "后来他又冒充律师，继续以虚假的身份行骗。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "bd78aae4088ff0f7759c8d64f0986bcbf9fd61dc061a353140a4f5e8e1f453e0",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.005
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "从神户到京都、名古屋，他不断更换衣着和说辞。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "9e935f3be3c687bf3c2cb960e0eff05b07f9dd336dd028084bce289ac200c59b",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.027
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "据公开资料，他诈骗所得合计约八十万日元。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "94ecabf54a136a92adb69f7b18aab6ca0b91fc705e2c25803c8a22d6ddcf5ad1",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.201
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "十一月，静冈滨松一家旅馆的经营者母女遇害。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "53edf1114b6fc7b1c6054cbf6bbbe291524d3dfac7e983be1893ce7447a4c540",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.725
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "两条生命消逝，旅馆里只剩下寂静。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "8f73117ccac48953345cd4b3c7a5be433752bfe367e83b45c78bed78ee977706",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.435
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "到了十二月末，东京的一位律师也成了受害者。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "4a114e051516a7a4b9c9d4035fc0829cf68222de769fb502e2473c373cc4893f",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.435
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "加上福冈的两人，遇害者一共是五人。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "89374274e1c59c3c6ee7cec130320daa9519bb4ac0f59f5c6555e311c0072f1e",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 3.541
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "一九六四年一月二日，他来到熊本玉名。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "81b23349dd99d5c2718fc49a350487c52d8d36e53ab7db407a3cf6129a8fdfbb",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.214
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "他冒充川村律师，拜访教诲师古川泰龙。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "3ffb9fcba8e5a81b9bf4034690103f74108e944703437fd8f912605c01c6cac1",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.899
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "他声称愿意帮助古川，为冤案奔走的活动。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "5738368663539938272e34d3b29529f8b539303c77476fefb5b4764cb615e6d9",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 3.831
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "一家人热情接待，女儿却觉得这张脸十分眼熟。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "32f01a9862f02977aa724bf551d40c1dc8d8a458552e6c901e9460ee4fd80d48",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.214
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "女孩想起路边的通缉照片，发现客人与照片很像。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "136286e272a730e90bc5f3e75c8886f59be63df3d6d5b7de30d2b834bda47d39",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.133
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "她把疑虑告诉家人；起初，父亲并没有相信。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "1a7f99be51bce530bccc696ef27cb5ca591c3c93c97a393737552f28ad3caf04",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.214
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "家人再三核对，古川最终决定悄悄向警方求助。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "9e6bcb9aeacdd64c8d3c6e3f4a786aec778117146580f72fccf8de8507de6121",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.818
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "警方核实身份，发现这名来客并非真正的律师。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "d7d637075e41ff8fdf93caa460399f649a8e4c87ce22a4362e7f3a9706328549",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.598
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "夜色中，警员赶到寺院附近，静静等待天亮。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "a9f02a6c441b8aed550db22bb31be98ccb7a6a8cba4359f826d06cf3d9a0c446",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.725
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "一月三日，警方确认身份，西口终于被捕。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "3aa5739bed7f4b98faff1fe9d8383c8f3b68bb31125debdd10186bf478f006a7",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.133
    }
  ]
}
